{"synopsis":"Jun-ho mewarisi truk makanan milik mendiang pamannya, Deok-chun. Ia pun berkeliling negeri, memasak demi membuat nama “Go Deok-chun” dikenal secara nasional. Perjalanannya dimulai dengan Se-hee, pewaris keluarga konglomerat, dan berlanjut dengan pertemuan Jun-ho bersama para wanita di setiap daerah yang ia singgahi, masing-masing dengan kisahnya sendiri! Mereka semua jatuh hati padanya, namun satu hal yang benar-benar merebut hati Jun-ho… adalah memasak!\n\nIkuti perjalanan romantis Jun-ho yang tak tertahankan bersama truk makanannya keliling negeri—bisnis, dimulai!","alternative_title":"고덕춘의 푸드트럭","author":"Popo (III)","artist":"Popo (III)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5eb56824-fa61-4124-9301-9c4c3609bd13","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"6867e724-5041-4909-bb85-2608547b0a62","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"67b77bb4-ca8b-44aa-bdad-a82eafa5a204","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"c43b62f5-c93e-40e2-8352-60c9a590d06b","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"6c607e69-1f2c-4a13-a97d-11a3eb256bd8","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"396fae31-863d-46ef-ade0-3b1ddce77361","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"1056a3d6-684f-4364-9acc-641445634f0e","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"db2d9238-5280-43ad-a8b5-93865ea303e4","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"9eda9d3e-b189-4bae-abc0-bc340e748d02","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"d424b941-cbc6-4a87-8771-21a03da46ec6","number":"34","chapter":"34","